          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\cos^2\\theta-\\cos\\theta-3&=0\\\\(2\\cos\\theta-3)(\\cos\\theta+1)&=0\\\\\\cos\\theta&=\\frac32\\quad\\text{or}\\quad-1\\end{align*}$$\nReject $\\cos\\theta=\\frac32$ because $-1\\leq\\cos\\theta\\leq1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos\\theta&=-1\\\\\\theta&=180^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
