            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sec^2\\theta+\\sec\\theta-2&=0\\\\(\\sec\\theta+2)(\\sec\\theta-1)&=0\\\\\\sec\\theta&=-2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad1\\\\\\cos\\theta&=-\\frac12\\quad\\text{or}\\quad1\\\\\\theta&=0^\\circ,\\ 120^\\circ,\\ 240^\\circ,\\ 360^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\nCosine is nonzero at each solution, so secant is defined.",
